<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-St George cuts some loan, card rates.</title>
<headline>RTRS-St George cuts some loan, card rates.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>St George Bank Ltd said on Thursday it has cut its credit cards, personal loans and overdraft interest rates by the full 0.5 percentage point rate reduction announced on Wednesday by the Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA).</p>
<p>St George said the new rates are effective November 11 for new and existing St George customers.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
